re are two extra words"}, {"h": 0.013113921747310943, "x": 0.10156655087163415, "y": 0.7022456358392003, "text": "or phrases.", "w": 0.08263626946343315}, {"text": "badly-paid why in from eight hours a day", "y": 0.7294494587621152, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.3452593994140625, "x": 0.11806797169278993}, {"y": 0.7435465118132525, "x": 0.1198568940282844, "text": "part-time well-paid with", "w": 0.19677995469835072, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"h": 0.013919013553578026, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "text": "I work eight hours a day, so | get home at about six", "x": 0.09660108161775889, "y": 0.7701017442728476}, {"h": 0.015174417977728975, "text": "o'clock every evening. Unfortunately, it's a '", "x": 0.09838999247791612, "y": 0.7827470932102635, "w": 0.3076922946506076}, {"text": "job and I don't earn a lot, so l've also got a 2_", "y": 0.7977617329198619, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "x": 0.09660107568674786, "w": 0.32021467420789934}, {"w": 0.39177100287543404, "h": 0.01266817395867856, "x": 0.09660108726234247, "text": "job for two hours a day in the evening. The evening job", "y": 0.8130731050606271}, {"x": 0.09645730375703475, "y": 0.8251706508138738, "text": "is great. / work 3", "w": 0.11656661139594184, "h": 0.016315673964118243}, {"text": "a supermarket. I work on a", "w": 0.18651319715711806, "x": 0.3020719648649842, "y": 0.8252025071775227, "h": 0.015048325053190868}, {"x": 0.10017890174172085, "text": "checkout and there are always people there - customers", "y": 0.8409156977775692, "w": 0.3935599093967014, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"y": 0.8560901166161594, "w": 0.1681574164496528, "h": 0.012732085312316574, "x": 0.09660107542454752, "text": "and the people work."}, {"h": 0.012732085312316477, "x": 0.3506261188966305, "y": 0.8560901166414502, "text": ". My other job is", "w": 0.1180679745144314}, {"y": 0.05058139522382859, "x": 0.5313059090244449, "w": 0.4078711954752604, "h": 0.013909883895075349, "text": "4 Complete the dialogues with the words in 