876085, "text": "Jackie:"}, {"x": 0.7513416855598584, "y": 0.18209302367509836, "text": "(l/not/work) today.", "w": 0.1323792436387804, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"y": 0.19450028933307292, "x": 0.6260331933346384, "h": 0.01438604815341941, "w": 0.07709282769097225, "text": "Why not?"}, {"text": "The owner of the restaurant b", "w": 0.20751341078016494, "x": 0.6332737086528513, "y": 0.2084702167396545, "h": 0.011558852682044748}, {"text": "(get) married. The restaurant is closed for the", "x": 0.6314847869527486, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.223781588795672, "w": 0.3184257676866319}, {"y": 0.2376873927135124, "x": 0.633260640245902, "text": "weekend.", "h": 0.010206610003103009, "w": 0.06979356977674689}, {"y": 0.2528339351028471, "w": 0.11270124647352431, "text": "Conversation 3", "x": 0.554561722112075, "h": 0.00902978339350174}, {"text": "Manager: Why *", "y": 0.2668168605998803, "w": 0.1252236090766059, "h": 0.012713825246487384, "x": 0.5527728124116076}, {"y": 0.27946220935435195, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "Waiter: He's tired. He b", "w": 0.18783542209201387, "x": 0.5527728070040826}, {"text": "(Seth/sit) down?", "x": 0.7817531352200755, "y": 0.26539711181851733, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.1198568810356988}, {"y": 0.28070848371713614, "text": "_ (have) a rest.", "h": 0.011399074297949709, "w": 0.09660107082790792, "x": 0.8443649374393556}, {"text": "/5", "x": 0.9320214677572723, "w": 0.01967799504597989, "y": 0.3034883722387706, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"x": 0.5277280850255563, "y": 0.32232400692372454, "w": 0.37209303114149306, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "5 Complete the text with the correct form of the"}, {"w": 0.3899820963541667, "text": "verbs in brackets. Use the Present Simple or Present", "x": 0.5527728223655521, "y": 0.33763081412535745, "h": 0.011389943890623196}, {"x": 0.5545617247139608, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "Continuous. Add the correct personal pronouns.", "y": 0.3513763535674408, "w": 0.35599283854166663}, {"text": "Hi Sally,", "x": 0.5456171750969089, "h": 0.01264534831477405, "w": 0.055456169976128566, "y": 0.37683139557844153}, {"w": 0.08944543626573342, "text": "How are you?", "x": 0.5474060825528816, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.39327034908833464}, {"w": 0.3613595581054688, "x": 0.5474060930850114, "y": 0.4059156978304809, "text": "Do you remember (remember) Jake Samuels? He's in", "h": 0.011417334738190817}, {"text": "India at the moment. 1", "w": 0.15251461452907988, "h": 0.013121332106607472, "x": 0.545421412671648, "y": 0.4184781495314213}, {"w": 0.1359570651584201, "h": 0.014133574007220128, "text": "(work) as an English", "x": 0.8067978548984286, "y": 0.4196886283675473}, {"w": 0.16636850992838548, "x": 0.5456171776476141, "text": "teacher for a few weeks. 2", "y": 0.43373546522409034, "h": 0.010294318224979204}, {"text": "(love) it.", "y": 0.43360987475421997, "w": 0.05735524919297963, "h": 0.012896529242450144, "x": 0.8192651306346728}, {"w": 0.010733451843261799, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "text": "3", "x": 0.5438282653127161, "y": 0.4476453489096376}, {"y": 0.4487409745580409, "text": "(not/want) to come home! Do you know", "x": 0.6636851600996915, "w": 0.2665473937988281, "h": 0.011549723023541975}, {"text": "he's got a blog?\"", "x": 0.5435895996159053, "y": 0.462464330208434, "w": 0.11864458719889315, "h": 0.014196908017788558}, {"x": 0.7674418629022959, "text": "(write) it every day. It's", "y": 0.4628197677663047, "w": 0.15563505384657117, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"x": 0.542039349598505, "text": "really interesting. And now, because of reading his blog", "h": 0.012759476534296018, "w": 0.37567084418402774, "y": 0.4766155232677131}, {"text": "5", "x": 0.5438282649818252, "y": 0.489375000030277, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "h": 0.0075872089888644875}, {"text": "(dream) about life in a foreign country.", "h": 0.012672739536753685, "x": 0.661896250476057, "y": 0.49063953511332514, "w": 0.2629695807562935}, {"w": 0.33094811333550345, "x": 0.5420393616462017, "h": 0.012704694839160775, "text": "I think that would be so cool! Maybe we can work", "y": 0.5044900724995489}, {"x": 0.5438282679073824, "y": 0.5184593027029374, "text": "somewhere for a year after we finish our studies?", "h": 0.011549722649130153, "w": 0.33094811333550345}, {"x": 0.542039363814591, "y": 0.5323646207838486, "w": 0.3953488159179688, "h": 0.012649913892849175, "text": "I know - it's a long way in the future, but I'm really excited!"}, {"y": 0.5507498555183601, "w": 0.08441694471571182, "h": 0.013820055753315361, "x": 0.5418702385752835, "text": "All the best,"}, {"h": 0.01138081348329678, "text": "Jess", "x": 0.5402504469357555, "y": 0.5665116279998124, "w": 0.032200357649061484}, {"x": 0.9159212875622736, "y": 0.5614534885304857, "text": "/5", "w": 0.01967799716525609, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"x": 0.5277280975441858, "w": 0.2683363003200955, "y": 0.595573104639018, "h": 0.011403639501612918, "text": "6 Choose the correct answers A-C."}, {"w": 0.05206990983751092, "x": 0.541943578695019, "h": 0.011824476546759204, "y": 0.619400261718421, "text": "Hi Jess,"}, {"h": 0.015544530080113637, "y": 0.6347615813251118, "text": "Thanks for C email. Of course I remember Jake. I!", "w": 0.33470618353949644, "x": 0.5419701740919561}, {"text": "at his blog right now. You're right. It's amazing. I love the", "y": 0.6499709300822588, "w": 0.38103756374782993, "h": 0.013914448724326735, "x": 0.5420393614713443}, {"h": 0.015295192007553783, "y": 0.662549166362862, "w": 0.3545444403754341, "x": 0.5436579202963432, "text": "photos too. Are they really his pictures? Perhaps he 2"}, {"y": 0.6790552327774286, "w": 0.4042933824327257, "text": "them on the Internet! I'm joking! I know they are his photos.", "h": 0.01152689700522574, "x": 0.5438282691145851}, {"w": 0.2915921359592014, "y": 0.6929377258927151, "x": 0.5420393547619019, "text": "They're all selfies of him in amazing places!", "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"x": 0.5420393674435201, "w": 